[ti:It Moved With Me]
[ar:Giuntru]
[re:Automatic line alignment - listening review pending]
[00:09.02]I did not move on
[00:12.04]I learned the shape
[00:14.28]Of carrying
[00:15.14]I gave it silence
[00:17.26]I gave it distance
[00:18.48]I gave it every name
[00:19.74]That sounded clean
[00:20.70]But it did not stay behind
[00:22.26]It did not become past
[00:23.76]It changed its weight
[00:24.82]Changed its voice
[00:25.98]Changed the place
[00:27.02]Where it lived in me
[00:28.48]Not as a wound
[00:29.42]Not only
[00:30.34]Not as a ghost
[00:31.18]Not only
[00:32.10]More like a second pulse
[00:33.36]Under the first
[00:34.22]A light that hurt
[00:35.34]And still kept breathing
[00:37.38]Still moving
[00:43.66]Still breathing
[00:44.82]Changed in shape
[00:46.74]Still near me
[00:49.54]It moved with me
[00:50.84]Not behind
[00:52.04]Not ahead
[00:53.20]It moved with me
[00:54.34]Through the hand
[00:54.90]Through the breath
[00:55.52]I did not leave it
[00:57.02]I did not win
[00:57.82]It found another way
[01:00.28]To live within
[01:08.26]I wanted justice
[01:08.94]I wanted sense
[01:10.00]One clean line
[01:10.94]Between what happened
[01:11.90]And what remained
[01:12.70]But life kept moving
[01:13.96]Without asking why
[01:15.18]And I kept moving
[01:16.22]With it inside
[01:17.26]Do not erase
[01:18.28]Do not explain
[01:19.42]What enters deep
[01:20.58]Returns as shape
[01:21.76]So I stopped calling it
[01:23.44]An ending
[01:24.22]Stopped asking it
[01:25.74]To disappear
[01:26.52]Not forgiven
[01:27.50]Not forgotten
[01:28.64]Not released
[01:29.66]Not restored
[01:30.82]Just carried forward
[01:32.60]Changed in form
[01:35.58]It moved with me
[01:37.28]Not behind
[01:38.46]Not ahead
[01:39.62]It moved with me
[01:40.78]Through the hand
[01:41.30]Through the breath
[01:41.86]I did not leave it
[01:43.10]I did not win
[01:44.16]It found another way
[01:46.66]To live within
[01:54.26]And maybe later
[01:55.02]From another room
[01:57.04]I will see the shape
[01:59.50]Without the wound
[02:02.30]
[02:05.70]It moved with me
[02:09.58]Until I could see it
[02:13.66]
